※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4653

※ A type with type parameters is a type only once it is given them, except
※ where a value of it is written out and its fields say them.

type Pair(T') = first: T' ; second: T'

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let p: Pair = Pair(.first ← 1u8, .second ← 2u8)
    0u6
